      visibility: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;
      transition:
        box-shadow 0.2s ease,
        opacity 0.12s ease,
        visibility 0s linear 0.12s;
    }
  }

  @media (--bp-mobile) {
    /* Signed in with a photo, the closed menu key shows the face; open,
       the cross. 38px OUTSIDE, RING INCLUDED (2026-10-30, Josh: "the profile
       button has to be the same size as the portfolio buttons", then "the
       account pill still big"): the directory bar's circles are 38px on a
       phone with their hairline inside (--bar-h, border-box,
       CommunityGrid.astro). The disc was 38 with its ring outside, 40 in
       all; now a 36px disc inside the ring, the key's 40 around it.
       30px OUTSIDE (2026-10-31, Josh: "the profile itself need to be the same
       height as the buttons in a pill like portfolio"): a button inside the
       views pill is 30px (38 less its 3px inset and hairline), so the face
       is a 28px disc in its 1px ring, centred in the 40px key. Open, it
